why Redemption to raise fallen allies, plus a weapon and a shield for a new Forsaken paladin.

# The Forsaken Paladin order at Bandarion Keep (Tyr's Watch), new in Forever:
# A Second Home (91282) from Shari Stilwell in Brill, Murlocs at the Gates
# (91285), Touring the Grounds (91294), Making Repairs (91316), The Tarnished
# (91317) and A Token of Good Faith (95803, to Sylvanas), then the seven
# A Lesson in Divinity quests (94427-94441) that end with Redemption.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json (Questie-Forever)
# for givers, enders, objectives and spawns; Forever's quest data for
# the order of the chain (the data has no prerequisites for these quests), the
# rewards (Skullthumper or Driftwood Smasher, the Salvaged Wooden Tower Shield,
# the Symbol of Life, Redemption from Danitha Morr) and where things are:
# Bandarion Keep "on the bluffs just northwest of the Solliden Farmstead", the
# Sturdy Lumber in a root cellar at Shadowvale, Deathguard Falgan at Venomweb
# Vale, Billmuth "downstairs" in the keep.
# The leveling guide (forever/horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades) leaves this
# chain out: three crossings of the glades for a spell solo leveling does not
# need. Take this guide from Brill at level 9 (Shari offers A Second Home at
# 8, The Tarnished needs 9); the Redemption half needs level 12. Danitha Morr
# also starts the level 18 chain in Silverpine
# (forever/class/paladin/lumina-windsinger).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Bandarion Keep

step Shari Stilwell
  tip Shari Stilwell, who trains Paladins in Brill, sends you to the order's keep on the west coast.
  accept 91282                        -- Shari Stilwell, Brill

step Bandarion Keep
  tip Bandarion Keep stands on the bluffs north-west of the Solliden Farmstead. Breton Samuels waits at the gate.
  turnin 91282                        -- Breton Samuels
  accept 91285

step Murlocs at the Gates
  tip The Vile Fin murlocs lurk on the bluffs along the road east of the keep and in the camps around the lake to the west.
  kill 250283 quest 91285.1           -- Vile Fin Attackers
  kill 250282 quest 91285.2           -- Vile Fin Seers

step Touring the Grounds
  turnin 91285 choose 246164 246165   -- Breton Samuels
  accept 91294
  talk 246389                         -- Hilda the Breaker
  talk 246393                         -- Jorin Croge
  talk 246394                         -- Ander Solliden

step Danitha Morr
  tip Danitha Morr leads the order from inside the keep; Jorin Croge stands beside it.
  turnin 91294                        -- Danitha Morr
  accept 91317
  accept 91316                        -- Jorin Croge

step Shadowvale
  tip The Tarnished hold the ruined village of Shadowvale in the Whispering Forest, south-west of the keep. The Sturdy Lumber is piled in the root cellar of one of its houses; Commander Rudolph Gelhardt walks among his Tarnished.
  collect 246213 quest 91316.1        -- Lumber Pile, in the root cellar
  kill 259434 quest 91317.1           -- Tarnished Drudges
  kill 259433 quest 91317.2           -- Tarnished Zealots
  collect 270435 quest 91317.3        -- Rudolph Gelhardt's Head

step Back to the keep
  turnin 91316 choose 246265          -- Jorin Croge
  turnin 91317                        -- Danitha Morr
  accept 95803

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- A Lesson in Divinity

step A Lesson in Divinity
  tip Danitha offers the first Lesson in Divinity at level 12.
  level 12
  accept 94427                        -- Danitha Morr

step The Undercity
  zone Undercity
  tip Walk south from Brill to the Ruins of Lordaeron and down into the Undercity. Lady Sylvanas Windrunner holds court in the Royal Quarter; Tanis Alderwood begs in the Trade Quarter.
  turnin 95803                        -- Lady Sylvanas Windrunner
  turnin 94427                        -- Tanis Alderwood
  accept 94434

step Linen Cloth
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip Tanis needs 10 Linen Cloth. Scarlet Zealots and Scarlet Friars drop it about three times in ten; bring it along if you already carry some.
  collect 2589 quest 94434.1

step Tanis Alderwood
  zone Undercity
  turnin 94434
  accept 94435

step The Symbol of Life
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip Back to Bandarion Keep. Danitha gives you the Symbol of Life; Deathguard Billmuth waits downstairs in the keep.
  turnin 94435                        -- Danitha Morr: Symbol of Life
  accept 94436
  turnin 94436                        -- Deathguard Billmuth
  accept 94438

step Deathguard Falgan
  tip Venomweb Vale is at the far east end of the glades. Use the Symbol of Life on Deathguard Falgan, then speak to him. If you lose the symbol, Danitha Morr gives you another.
  turnin 94438                        -- Deathguard Falgan
  accept 94440

step The Scarlet attack plans
  tip The Scarlet Crusaders camped around Venomweb Vale carry the attack plans.
  collect 264693 quest 94440.1

step Redemption
  tip Back to Bandarion Keep: Billmuth takes the plans, Danitha teaches you Redemption.
  turnin 94440                        -- Deathguard Billmuth
  accept 94441
  turnin 94441                        -- Danitha Morr: Redemption
